  "limits": [
    "Pure unit/static evidence only. No real database/RLS/race, current-owner, original object-byte, provider or complete release proof. Counts from overlapping executions and reference vectors are not summed.",
    "The compact projection proves supplied correspondence, not authentic origin or authoritative completeness. A later application must re-enumerate and revalidate on the same held connection and verify Documents bytes separately.",
    "RF owner wire preserves source representation. Cross-owner Documents metadata retains its own canonical UTC hashing semantics; no uncommitted offset provenance is invented.",
    "Ordinary PR CI on cdce7100 excludes this slice. New CI is required after commit; both linked immutable complete gates and A1\u2013A7 remain pending.",
    "No fresh writer, approval/claim/intent, runtime or provider activation; no Archive-owner completion/eligibility exception, production filing, real-company admission, outreach, paid action or launch clearance."
  ]
